"diagonalization-algorithms/qda-4-sqd-implementation/extracted-"
"outputs/8cd90034-6ef3-41bd-a847-c115cade82f7-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/quantum-"
"diagonalization-algorithms/qda-4-sqd-implementation/extracted-"
"outputs/8cd90034-6ef3-41bd-a847-c115cade82f7-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise for the reader {#exercise-for-the-reader}"
msgstr "Ehersisyo para sa mambabasa {#exercise-for-the-reader}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Progressively increase the `samples_per_batch` parameter (for example, from "
"$1000$ to $10000$ at a step of $1000$; permitted my your computer's memory) "
"and compare the estimated ground state energies.\n"
msgstr ""
"Unti-unting dagdagan ang parameter na `samples_per_batch` (halimbawa, mula "
"$1000$ hanggang $10000$ sa hakbang na $1000$; hanggang sa kapasidad ng "
"memorya ng iyong computer) at ihambing ang mga tinatantyang ground state "
"energy.\n"

